      **Speed** 50 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Initiative) (12)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=24)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=3)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-4,label=-4,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=9)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=21)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=6)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Senses** Passive Perception 10  
      **Languages** -  
      **Challenge** 6 (2,300 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +3  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The mammoth makes two Gore attacks.

      ***Gore.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+10,label=+10,dicelabel=To Hit [Gore]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d10+7,dicelabel=Damage [Gore]) Piercing damage. If the target is a Huge or smaller creature and the mammoth moved 20+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target has the ***Prone*** condition.

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Trample.*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 18, one creature within 5 feet that has the ***Prone*** condition. *Failure:* rollable(dice=4d10+7,dicelabel=Damage [Trample]) Bludgeoning damage. *Success:* Half damage.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
